Package: rgbctl
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, udev, systemd
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: HoanNguyen1711 <ngviethoan@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/HoanNguyen1711/jonsbo-aio-led-ubuntu
Description: LED control for Jonsbo AIO/fans, Gigabyte RGB Fusion 2 and Corsair DDR5
 Small tool to control the ARGB headers and onboard LEDs of Gigabyte boards
 with the ITE IT5711 controller (Jonsbo fans and AIO plug in here), Corsair
 Vengeance RGB DDR5 memory over SMBus, and the CPU temperature display on
 Jonsbo AIO pump blocks (USB 5131:2007). Includes a CLI, a GTK4 window, a tray
 icon and a user daemon that keeps effects in sync across all devices.
